# Boot -> title -> map zoom-out loading -> free roam, then quit the way a player does: the pause menu's QUIT GAME (the Settings tab's last row).
# For launcher/dev/exit_probe.py (the exit hang, launcher/dev/exit-hang-2026-10-29.md). Run it with --keep-open (the game ends by the menu, not by the script).
# The Settings list on Windows is OPTIONS, STATISTICS, CHEAT CODES, MUSIC PLAYLISTS, DISPLAY, PERFORMANCE, CONTROLS, RESTART GAME, QUIT GAME: 9 rows, QUIT GAME is row 8.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 5s
log exit: pause menu
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
wait_until ui_count == 9 10s
press_until down ui_select == 8 every=700ms hold=150ms timeout=30s
wait 600ms 36f
log exit: QUIT GAME selected
uisel
press a 4f
mark end
wait 60s
